 "final_summary": "The bug was caused by the sorting logic incorrectly setting the direction to 'ASC' when a leading '-' was present in the sort parameter. The fix correctly sets the direction to 'DESC' for descending sort, ensuring tasks are sorted in descending order by priority. The test and full suite now pass, confirming the fix works as expected.",
